  "text": "BluePearl Pet Neurology | Farmington, MI\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Neurology Farmington, MI\nBluePearl Pet Neurology\nFarmington, MI\nSpecialty\n248.516.1122\n33300 W 9 Mile Rd.\nFarmington, MI 48336\n[email protected]\nMon-Sat:\n7 am-7 pm\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nBluePearl Pet Neurology Farmington - serving the Greater Detroit area.\nWe are located in Farmington, Michigan, serving pets with neurological conditions in greater Detroit, Ann Arbor and beyond, including the entire tri-state area of Ohio, Indiana and Michigan.\nOur reviews.\nOur services.\nIf your pet requires the expertise of a veterinary neurology specialist, we’re here to help. Our dedicated team of veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff collaborates closely to deliver comprehensive and compassionate care that your pet both needs and deserves.\nSpecialty care\nAvailable by referral, our neurology team at Dogwood provides advanced care to pets with neurological illnesses and conditions. We offer state-of-the-art specialty diagnostics, treatments and procedures to ensure the highest level of care for our patients.\nSee Specialties and Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of veterinarians here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nAbout BluePearl Pet Neurology Farmington.\nOur hospital, formerly known as Dogwood Veterinary Referral Center, was created because we understand the anxiety and concern that arises when learning about your pet's neurologic condition. Take comfort in knowing that advanced neurologic care is our team's sole focus.\nOur mission is to enhance your pet's quality of life by providing you and your family veterinarian with information and treatment options, empowering you to make informed and confident decisions regarding your pet's well-being.\nWe take great pride in upholding high standards of progressive medicine, advanced neurosurgery and compassionate care. What truly sets us apart is our team members, many of whom have personally experienced having pets with neurologic conditions.\nWe understand the challenges, and our compassionate medical team will support you and your pet throughout the entire diagnostic, treatment and recovery process.\nPet owners.\nAt BluePearl, providing our customers with remarkable service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions prior to your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our hospital team at\n248.516.1122\nor\n[email protected]\n.\nCurrent location.\n248.516.1122\n248.516.1155\n33300 W 9 Mile Rd.\nFarmington,\nMI                                    48336\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nSouthfield, MI\n29080 Inkster Rd.\nSouthfield, MI 48034\n248.354.6640\n4.31 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nAuburn Hills, MI\n3412 E Walton Blvd.\nAuburn Hills, MI 48326\n248.371.3713\n17.22 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nAnn Arbor, MI\n4126 Packard Rd.\nAnn Arbor, MI 48108\n734.971.8774\n22.58 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie Settings",
